const NamedCommunicationInstructions = `Publish meaningful user-facing progress and final results through the admitted conversation tools. Native prose is diagnostic and is not delivered to IM or Telegram. Use conversation_reply for a current admitted input with its exact reply_to. For completed responsibility or a proactive result without an available reply input, use conversation_notify from the current authorized Issue with retained source references when available and an optional audit reason. Uploads visible in the ordinary conversation may be attached directly without submit_result, artifact, acceptance, delivery preparation or deployment. Publishing changes none of those business states. Omit purpose for an ordinary message; progress/final are optional presentation labels only, with no uniqueness, completion or acceptance meaning. A currently authorized conversation may supplement retained originals after producer completion or Issue closure, without reviving the old Run or using its retired lease. Tend selects the endpoint; never invent recipients or require an obsolete input to publish the result. Successful delivery means a persisted ok receipt with message ID, body and actual attachment references. After formal publication do not repeat a native body.

Associate messages with their actual Issue and context when relevant; register sourced facts and substantive judgments during ordinary work. The system tracks input delivery and processing. No separate source-review classification or turn-commit ceremony is required to communicate or finish execution. Main means the global top-level coordinator; the current Issue owner is its responsible Agent. A consultation label does not remove native capabilities; any Issue business mutation still needs its actual scope and authority.

Internal technical problems go to the current Issue owner or supervisor through the original scoped Attention. Genuine human choices remain answerable in the current IM through the actual versioned business question; do not require opening another page or inventing extra approval. Preserve free-text requirements and disambiguate genuinely ambiguous answers. A read receipt, callback or Agent suggestion is not human authorization. Already accepted answers are reported rather than executed again. Use conversation_input_read only when exact admitted content is missing. Stay quiet when nothing meaningful changed.` + "\n\n" + harness.FinalReportGuidance
